 / CH2 bypass&lt;br&gt;(never both · switch only with loads quiet)&lt;br&gt;BUZZER KY-012 (low-side: + to 3V3)&lt;br&gt;BUTTONS / TOGGLE / OPTO / DOOR read back" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="828" width="300" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="aht2" value="&lt;b&gt;DHT22 · cool-return path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GPIO10 + 10k · chamber source #2&lt;br&gt;(I2C1 free, GPIO11 spare)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="430" width="280" height="54" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hx711" value="&lt;b&gt;HX711 + 2×5 kg load cells&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CLK = 1 · DOUT = 2 · dry-to-weight&lt;br&gt;cells OUTSIDE the hot chamber" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="494" width="280" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="divider" value="&lt;b&gt;BATTERY DIVIDER&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;100k / 15k → ADC 4&lt;br&gt;gate = GPIO5 (2N7000)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="578" width="280" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="phone" value="&lt;b&gt;ANY PHONE (browser only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WiFi AgarbattiDryer / dryer1234&lt;br&gt;http://192.168.4.1&lt;br&gt;dashboard · parameters · history" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="866" width="280" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pcbox" value="&lt;b&gt;PC — Arduino IDE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;network OTA:&lt;br&gt;smart-dryer at 192.168.4.1&lt;br&gt;or USB serial 115200" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry