+ B('loads2', 'DRIVEN VIA PCF #2\n2-CH SUPPLY RELAY — CH1 solar / CH2 bypass\n(never both · switch only with loads quiet)\nBUZZER KY-012 (low-side: + to 3V3)\nBUTTONS / TOGGLE / OPTO / DOOR read back', 40, 828, 300, 110, 'gold'),
